---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Measurements from '../components/Measurements.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Local LLM server for AMD Strix Halo on Windows | Halowin Bubo" description="Halowin Bubo is an open-source local LLM server for AMD Strix Halo laptops on Windows (ROCm/HIP). 55 tok/s decode at 70 W. Download v0.1.0.">
  <section class="home-intro" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <span class="eyebrow">Open source · Native Windows · AMD Strix Halo</span>
    <h1 id="home-title">A local LLM server for AMD Strix Halo, native on Windows</h1>
    <p class="subhead">The most intelligence a laptop can fit</p>
    <p class="intro">General-purpose tools such as LM Studio, Ollama and llama.cpp aim at every GPU. gufo, the engine under Halowin Bubo, aims at one chip, AMD Strix Halo: it keeps only the best models that fit, protects quality while it optimizes, and treats many users, cancellation and chat caching as core work. Bubo, from HaloForge Labs, brings that approach to native Windows with AMD HIP. It is open source and decodes at 55 tok/s at only 70 W.</p>
    <div class="cta-row"><a class="button" href="https://github.com/haloforge-labs/bubo/releases/tag/v0.1.0">Download v0.1.0 for Windows</a><a class="cta-link" href="/docs/system-setup/">System setup <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <p class="card-note">MIT license. First release (v0.1.0): see the <a href="/docs/known-issues/">known issues</a>.</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-label="Halowin Bubo benchmarks">
    <Measurements compact />
    <p class="measure-note">NPU prefill is on by default: about 5 to 7% faster prefill at 8K tokens and 3.5 to 5.5% at 16K. <a href="/docs/npu/">NPU prefill <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
    <p class="measure-note">See the <a href="/docs/benchmarks/#test-conditions">test conditions</a> for every number here.</p>
    <a href="/docs/benchmarks/">Read the benchmark details <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </section>
  <section class="home-visual" aria-labelledby="flat-title">
    <h2 id="flat-title">Decode stays flat as the chat grows</h2>
    <figure class="chart-figure">
      <svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 480 236" role="img" aria-labelledby="chart-title chart-desc"><title id="chart-title">Decode speed by context depth</title><desc id="chart-desc">Decode speed in tokens per second for six context depths: 28 to 32K 51.12 (6 turns); 32 to 64K 54.40 (33 turns); 64 to 96K 51.44 (8 turns); 96 to 128K 52.78 (18 turns); 128 to 160K 52.51 (33 turns); 160 to 189K 52.45 (15 turns).</desc><line class="grid" x1="46" x2="466" y1="204.0" y2="204.0"/><text class="yl" x="38" y="208.0" text-anchor="end">0</text><line class="grid" x1="46" x2="466" y1="144.0" y2="144.0"/><text class="yl" x="38" y="148.0" text-anchor="end">20</text><line class="grid" x1="46" x2="466" y1="84.0" y2="84.0"/><text class="yl" x="38" y="88.0" text-anchor="end">40</text><line class="grid" x1="46" x2="466" y1="24.0" y2="24.0"/><text class="yl" x="38" y="28.0" text-anchor="end">60</text><rect class="bar" x="58.0" y="50.6" width="46" height="153.4" rx="2"/><text class="val" x="81.0" y="44.6" text-anchor="middle">51.1</text><text class="xl" x="81.0" y="224" text-anchor="middle">28–32K</text><rect class="bar" x="128.0" y="40.8" width="46" height="163.2" rx="2"/><text class="val" x="151.0" y="34.8" text-anchor="middle">54.4</text><text class="xl" x="151.0" y="224" text-anchor="middle">32–64K</text><rect class="bar" x="198.0" y="49.7" width="46" height="154.3" rx="2"/><text class="val" x="221.0" y="43.7" text-anchor="middle">51.4</text><text class="xl" x="221.0" y="224" text-anchor="middle">64–96K</text><rect class="bar" x="268.0" y="45.7" width="46" height="158.3" rx="2"/><text class="val" x="291.0" y="39.7" text-anchor="middle">52.8</text><text class="xl" x="291.0" y="224" text-anchor="middle">96–128K</text><rect class="bar" x="338.0" y="46.5" width="46" height="157.5" rx="2"/><text class="val" x="361.0" y="40.5" text-anchor="middle">52.5</text><text class="xl" x="361.0" y="224" text-anchor="middle">128–160K</text><rect class="bar" x="408.0" y="46.6" width="46" height="157.4" rx="2"/><text class="val" x="431.0" y="40.6" text-anchor="middle">52.5</text><text class="xl" x="431.0" y="224" text-anchor="middle">160–189K</text></svg>
      <figcaption>Decode speed in tok/s by context depth. 113 turns across three real agent sessions, measured 8 October 2026 at about 70 W. <a href="/docs/benchmarks/">Benchmarks <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
  <section class="home-visual" aria-labelledby="start-title">
    <h2 id="start-title">Start in three commands</h2>
    <div class="terminal">
      <button class="copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy the commands">Copy</button>
      <pre tabindex="0"><code># 1. Download the AMD runtime and the model
.\bubo.exe prepare

# 2. Start the server
$model = "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\Bubo\models\huihui-qwen38-flash-next-ud-q4-k-xl-v1\Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-UD-Q4_K_XL-00001-of-00004.gguf"
.\bubo.exe serve llm --model $model --served-model-name bubo

# 3. Ask a question from a second PowerShell window
'&#123;"model":"bubo","messages":[&#123;"role":"user","content":"Hello"&#125;]&#125;' | curl.exe -s http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/chat/completions -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "@-"</code></pre>
    </div>
    <p class="measure-note">The first command asks for your approval before it downloads. <a href="/docs/install/">Install guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
<script>
  const btn = document.querySelector('.terminal .copy');
  const code = document.querySelector('.terminal code');
  btn?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(code?.textContent ?? ''); btn.textContent = 'Copied'; }
    catch { btn.textContent = 'Press Ctrl+C'; }
    setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = 'Copy'; }, 1800);
  });
</script>
<style>
  .subhead { font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.4vw, 1.8rem); line-height: 1.3; margin: -8px 0 22px; color: var(--ink); max-width: 690px; }
  .home-visual { margin-top: 56px; }
  .chart-figure { margin: 0; max-width: 640px; }
  .chart { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .chart .grid { stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; }
  .chart .bar { fill: var(--accent); }
  .chart .val { fill: var(--ink); font: 13px var(--serif); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .chart .xl, .chart .yl { fill: var(--muted); font: 12.5px var(--serif); }
  .chart-figure figcaption { color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 10px; }
  .terminal { position: relative; max-width: 820px; }
  .terminal pre { margin: 0; background: var(--wash); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px 20px; overflow-x: auto; }
  .terminal code { font: .88rem/1.65 var(--mono); color: var(--ink); white-space: pre; }
  .terminal .copy { position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; z-index: 1; font: .8rem var(--serif); color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 10px; cursor: pointer; }
</style>
